### Trade System Tests

### 1. Criar proposta de troca
POST http://localhost:3004/marketplace/createTrade
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "proposer_id": "user123",
  "receiver_id": "user456",
  "target_post_id": "post123",
  "offers": [
    {
      "post_id": "post456",
      "cash_amount": null
    },
    {
      "post_id": null,
      "cash_amount": 500.00
    }
  ],
  "message": "Interessado em trocar meu item + R$ 500,00 pelo seu item",
  "expiresInHours": 72
}

### 2. Buscar trades do usuário
GET http://localhost:3004/marketplace/getUserTrades?userId=user123

### 3. Aceitar proposta de troca
PUT http://localhost:3004/marketplace/updateTradeStatus
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tradeId": "TRADE_ID_AQUI",
  "userId": "user456",
  "status": "accepted"
}

### 4. Rejeitar proposta de troca
PUT http://localhost:3004/marketplace/updateTradeStatus
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tradeId": "TRADE_ID_AQUI",
  "userId": "user456",
  "status": "rejected"
}

### 5. Cancelar proposta de troca
DELETE http://localhost:3004/marketplace/cancelTrade
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trade_id": "TRADE_ID_AQUI",
  "user_id": "user123"
}

### Auction System Tests

### 6. Criar leilão
POST http://localhost:3004/marketplace/createAuction
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "post_id": "post789",
  "seller_id": "user123",
  "starting_bid": 1000.00,
  "reserve_price": 1500.00,
  "duration_hours": 24
}

### 7. Fazer lance
POST http://localhost:3004/marketplace/placeBid
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "auction_id": "AUCTION_ID_AQUI",
  "bidder_id": "user456",
  "bid_amount": 1200.00
}

### 8. Listar leilões ativos
GET http://localhost:3004/marketplace/getActiveAuctions

### 9. Listar todos os leilões
GET http://localhost:3004/marketplace/getAuctions

### 10. Listar leilões com filtros
GET http://localhost:3004/marketplace/getAuctions?status=active&min_price=1000&limit=10

### 11. Buscar leilão por ID
GET http://localhost:3004/marketplace/getAuction/AUCTION_ID_AQUI

### 12. Finalizar leilão
PUT http://localhost:3004/marketplace/endAuction
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "auction_id": "AUCTION_ID_AQUI",
  "user_id": "user123"
}

### 13. Buscar leilões por vendedor
GET http://localhost:3004/marketplace/getAuctionsBySeller?seller_id=user123

### Advanced Trade Examples

### 14. Criar proposta de troca complexa
POST http://localhost:3004/marketplace/createTrade
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "proposer_id": "user789",
  "receiver_id": "user123",
  "target_post_id": "post_legendary",
  "offers": [
    {
      "post_id": "post_rare_1",
      "cash_amount": null
    },
    {
      "post_id": "post_rare_2",
      "cash_amount": null
    },
    {
      "post_id": null,
      "cash_amount": 2000.00
    }
  ],
  "message": "Ofereço 2 itens raros + R$ 2000,00 pelo seu item lendário",
  "expiresInHours": 48
}

### 15. Criar proposta de troca apenas com dinheiro
POST http://localhost:3004/marketplace/createTrade
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "proposer_id": "user456",
  "receiver_id": "user789",
  "target_post_id": "post_epic",
  "offers": [
    {
      "post_id": null,
      "cash_amount": 3000.00
    }
  ],
  "message": "Ofereço R$ 3000,00 pelo seu item épico",
  "expiresInHours": 24
}

### Advanced Auction Examples

### 16. Criar leilão de item raro
POST http://localhost:3004/marketplace/createAuction
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "post_id": "post_legendary_sword",
  "seller_id": "user123",
  "starting_bid": 5000.00,
  "reserve_price": 8000.00,
  "duration_hours": 48
}

### 17. Fazer lance em leilão
POST http://localhost:3004/marketplace/placeBid
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "auction_id": "AUCTION_ID_AQUI",
  "bidder_id": "user456",
  "bid_amount": 5500.00
}

### 18. Fazer lance maior
POST http://localhost:3004/marketplace/placeBid
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "auction_id": "AUCTION_ID_AQUI",
  "bidder_id": "user789",
  "bid_amount": 6000.00
}
